{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 2 of the [[1958 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place from 8 to 15 June 1958. The group consisted of [[France national football team|France]], [[Paraguay national football team|Paraguay]], [[Scotland national football team|Scotland]], and [[Yugoslavia national football team|Yugoslavia]].<ref>{{cite web |last1=Stokkermans |first1=Karel |last2=Jarreta |first2=Sergio Henrique |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/58f.html |title=World Cup 1958 (Sweden, June 8–29) |website=RSSSF.com |publisher=[[Rec.Sport.Soccer Statistics Foundation]] |date=22 October 1999 |access-date=22 May 2018}}</ref>

